/*
 * Declares the OptionType class.
 *
 * An OptionType represents a value that may or may not be present. In Ymir,
 * options are closely tied to error handling: an unset option may carry an
 * exception describing why the value is unavailable. 
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::native::compound::option
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/native/compound/option.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-11-20
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
